{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "docs_strategy_arcana_master_plan_punktvis_masterplan",
      "label": "Arcana Executive OS \u2014 punktvis masterplan",
      "file_type": "document",
      "source_file": "docs/strategy/arcana-master-plan-punktvis.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Skiftet fr\u00e5n chatt till Executive OS gjordes n\u00e4r det blev tydligt att en chatt aldrig kan vara s\u00e4ker, sp\u00e5rbar eller s\u00e4ljbar; produkten byggs d\u00e4rf\u00f6r som ett virtuellt team av roller under en supreme orchestrator."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_strategy_arcana_master_plan_punktvis_execution_gateway_lock",
      "label": "P0 Architecture Lock \u2014 ExecutionGateway som enda v\u00e4g ut",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "docs/strategy/arcana-master-plan-punktvis.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Alla externa svar, all persist av AI-output och alla agent-k\u00f6rningar m\u00e5ste g\u00e5 via gateway; fail-closed vid gate-fel eller timeout och CI-lint stoppar routes som direktpersistar eller genererar text utan gateway-run-id."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_strategy_arcana_master_plan_punktvis_mandatory_pipeline",
      "label": "Obligatorisk pipeline: Request \u2192 InputRisk \u2192 Agent \u2192 OutputRisk \u2192 PolicyFloor \u2192 Persist \u2192 Audit \u2192 Notify",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "docs/strategy/arcana-master-plan-punktvis.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Ordningen \u00e4r immutabel s\u00e5 att riskbed\u00f6mning aldrig kan hoppas \u00f6ver f\u00f6r snabbhet; audit skrivs alltid, \u00e4ven n\u00e4r beslutet \u00e4r blocked."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_strategy_arcana_master_plan_punktvis_policy_floor",
      "label": "Immutabelt policy floor",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "docs/strategy/arcana-master-plan-punktvis.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Inga diagnoser, inga garantier och eskalering vid critical g\u00e4ller oavsett tenant; TenantConfig f\u00e5r styra personlighet och ton men aldrig safety."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_strategy_arcana_master_plan_punktvis_ai_never_publishes",
      "label": "AI f\u00e5r aldrig publicera sj\u00e4lv \u2014 allt g\u00e5r till draft",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "docs/strategy/arcana-master-plan-punktvis.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Owner aktiverar, och high/critical kr\u00e4ver manuell intervention \u2014 det g\u00f6r systemet revisionsv\u00e4nligt och g\u00f6r att en modellfelbed\u00f6mning aldrig n\u00e5r patient eller marknad direkt."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_strategy_arcana_master_plan_punktvis_multi_tenant_white_label",
