    {
      "id": "docs_strategy_arcana_master_plan_punktvis_go_no_go_matrix",
      "label": "Go/No-Go-matris f\u00f6r patientkanal (readiness score)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "docs/strategy/arcana-master-plan-punktvis.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Under 75 = No-Go, 75\u201384 = begr\u00e4nsad beta, 85 och \u00f6ver = kontrollerad Go; automatiska No-Go-triggers \u00e4r output utan gate, kringg\u00e5eligt policy floor, L5 live utan manuell intervention, restore-test \u00e4ldre \u00e4n 30 dagar, icke-immutabel auditkedja och overifierad tenant-isolation."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_strategy_arcana_master_plan_punktvis_agent_activation_order",
      "label": "Agent-roadmap: aktiveringsordning COO \u2192 CAO \u2192 CCO \u2192 CFO \u2192 CMO \u2192 Patient Agent",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "docs/strategy/arcana-master-plan-punktvis.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Interna, l\u00e5g-risk-agenter f\u00f6rst och patientkanalen sist enligt canon; CFO v\u00e4ntar tills billing-data finns eftersom agenten annars saknar underlag."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_strategy_arcana_master_plan_punktvis_gap_analysis",
      "label": "Gap-analys \u2014 det som \u00e4nnu inte \u00e4r canon",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "docs/strategy/arcana-master-plan-punktvis.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Elva \u00f6ppna omr\u00e5den \u2014 compliance/juridik, disaster recovery, tenant-livscykel, aff\u00e4rsmodell, klinisk s\u00e4kerhet, tillg\u00e4nglighet, GTM, kunskapsbas, telemetri-samtycke, kapacitet och tenant-SLA \u2014 listas explicit s\u00e5 att de inte f\u00f6rv\u00e4xlas med beslutad canon."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_strategy_arcana_master_plan_punktvis_cco_ny_surface",
      "label": "CCO-Ny \u2014 trekolumnsytan som operativ yta",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "docs/strategy/arcana-master-plan-punktvis.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Nya CCO byggs additivt i major-arcana-preview och varken /cco-next eller /cco r\u00f6rs f\u00f6rr\u00e4n ytan \u00e4r stabil; Svarstudio \u00e5teranv\u00e4nds som enda compose-system i st\u00e4llet f\u00f6r att bygga ett parallellt."
    },
    {
      "id": "docs_strategy_arcana_master_plan_punktvis_stabilisera_phase",
      "label": "Fasbeslut STABILISERA f\u00f6re EXPANDERA",
      "file_type": "concept",
