      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Maturity-bed\u00f6mningen var intern pilot ja, patientkanal no-go; expansion sker f\u00f6rst n\u00e4r blocker-kategorierna A\u2013D \u00e4r gr\u00f6na och readiness passerar tr\u00f6skeln."
    }
